# covers flr6/m8flr/m8ft/m8off/m8chop/trl/trlcal/etc.)
IOF_NQ_*.csv

# TopDog Cycle research: per-trade CSVs are regenerated, and the .npz bar cache
# is a rebuildable derivative of the .scid files (9 min/contract to rebuild).
IOF_topdog_*.csv
.topdog_bars_*.npz

# MOM / MR intraday engines (nq_intraday_engines.py): per-trade CSVs and the
# null-test logs are regenerated. Bars come from the .topdog_bars_*.npz cache
# ignored just above.
